OL,3,CThree-minute silence for Southport
OL,4,Cvictims
OL,6,FVictims and survivors of the attack on
OL,7,Fa Southport dance class will be
OL,8,Fremembered two years on.
OL,10,FAlice da Silva Aguiar, nine; Bebe
OL,11,FKing, six; and Elsie Dot Stancombe,
OL,12,Fseven, were killed at a Taylor Swift-
OL,13,Fthemed dance session on July 29 2024.
OL,15,FEight other children, dance teacher
OL,16,FLeanne Lucas and businessman John
OL,17,FHayes were physically injured in the
OL,18,Fattack.
OL,20,FA three-minute silence will be held in
OL,21,Fthe town at 3pm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
