PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785345525
OL,3,CThree-minute silence for Southport
OL,4,Cvictims
OL,6,FThe silence will be observed by public
OL,7,Fbodies including Sefton Council and
OL,8,Fmembers of the public are invited to
OL,9,Fjoin in, wherever they are at the time.
OL,11,FPeople have been encouraged not to
OL,12,Fleave floral tributes but instead to
OL,13,Fdonate to local causes.
OL,15,FLocals have been asked not to leave
OL,16,Ffloral tributes to mark two years
OL,17,Fsince the Southport attack this week.
OL,19,FFlags will also be lowered to half-
OL,20,Fmast on all public buildings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
