PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785345525
OL,3,CThree-minute silence for Southport
OL,4,Cvictims
OL,6,FIn an open letter to the community,
OL,7,FSefton Council said local spaces had
OL,8,Fbeen identified for residents to go to
OL,9,F"say a prayer, light a candle, speak
OL,10,Fto someone or spend a quiet moment
OL,11,Freflecting".
OL,13,FThe council said: "We fully understand
OL,14,Fthat many of us still need to grieve
OL,15,Fand to acknowledge the day and there
OL,16,Fis no right or wrong way to do this.
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@KO]uD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
