OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785345525
OL,3,CThree-minute silence for Southport
OL,4,Cvictims
OL,6,F"Whether you choose to attend a
OL,7,Freflective space, observe the silence,
OL,8,Fspend time with loved ones, or simply
OL,9,Ftake a quiet moment to yourself, we
OL,10,Fencourage everyone to do whatever
OL,11,Ffeels most appropriate to you."
